ared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"D73evJ9PZKxO3E5TaThe3w","review_id":"sX7xQlyhiRxBFmiSM3mFaQ","date":"2018-09-10T17:32:14","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9461196064949036,"text_excerpt":"This place has a fond place in my heart. When I first moved into the neighborhood Superior Grill was always a nice Wednesday date night to get your chips and queso on. Now that I actually live a lot closer than before, I rarely if ever get a chance to just walk over and have some good ole Tex-Mex. Now people like to downplay this place, saying its not the best around or it is super expensive, but when you get right down to it, this place is an institution! Their margaritas are good enough for the price of admission alone! My favorite is a frozen strawberry margarita to wash down my favorite menu item, (and favorite Tex-Mex menu item of all time!), the Fajita Steak Tampiquena! I have still..."},{"business_id":"D73evJ9PZKxO3E5TaThe3w","review_id":"7IhiRYNxwn4w8ZesHBG6Rg","date":"2018-01-06T22:52:34","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9455163478851318,"text_excerpt":"This place gets different reviews, but I have always enjoyed my meals. Great chips, guacamole and margaritas. I've had a few entrees and have always enjoyed the food. The service is great as well. I'm going back tonight! It gets crowded so you may have to wait, but it's worth it."},{"business_id":"D73evJ9PZKxO3E5TaThe3w","review_id":"pxK6__mMWKQaiNrigJe57A","date":"2013-06-22T02:10:40","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9397827386856079,"text_excerpt":"One of my favorite restaurants in New Orleans and a great place to get Margaritas (but of course you already know that from others' reviews of here). I love to come here for lunch, when the crowds are usually smaller and service faster. If you try to get seated on a weekend night, things get a little dicey. The ceviche is always on point, fajitas are done pretty well (they're pretty standard, nothing spectacular) and everything else I've ever ordered has been pretty solid, if not fantastic. Bottom line: what makes this place so popular is the location and atmosphere, but the food's not too bad either."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"D73evJ9PZKxO3E5TaThe3w","photo_id":"1XgKVYj-meqk_G9uONtSJw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/1XgKVYj-meqk_G9uONtSJw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.899679958820343},{"business_id":"D73evJ9PZKxO3E5TaThe3w","photo_id":"PJWfVCBxPkI0oKHncCaIZg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/PJWfVCBxPkI0oKHncCaIZg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8938466310501099},{"business_id":"D73evJ9PZKxO3E5TaThe3w","photo_id":"M6m1qlgW0RZBaA9U7SGqgw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/M6m1qlgW0RZBaA9U7SGqgw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8525664210319519},{"business_id":"D73evJ9PZKxO3E5TaThe3w","photo_id":"TX4n3ifyhxPcb1V2vPZgQQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/TX4n3ifyhxPcb1V2vPZgQQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8459400534629822},{"business_id":"D73evJ9PZKxO3E5TaThe3w","photo_id":"4Mmt5ZAPOavaatDphbX9LA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/4Mmt5ZAPOavaatDphbX9LA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7832019329071045}]},"notebook_case":null}
